      },
      "message": "docs(site): reference for the 3D milling operations\n\nOne section per Milling 3D kind in the registry (3D Pocket, 3D Finish,\nDeburr): what it is for and when to choose it over a neighbour, its key\nsettings by tab with the seed defaults, what it picks, its common\nrefusals, and how it is judged on a reduced-fidelity model. Linked from\nthe operations page; posting and refusals move down one weight, as in\nPR #1260, so the operation reference pages sit before them.\n\nRefs #1250\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
